    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="881c64e8-b658-5986-bb39-081b57af164c" activityNameId="fb2f5c19-6ea5-5dd1-96fb-962f9d47db68" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Methylcyclohexane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Methylcyclohexane, at plant
The process "methylcyclohexane, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of methylcyclohexane from toluene in Europe.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000108-87-2; 
Formula: C7H14; 
Synonyms: hexahydrotoluene, cyclohexyl methane; 
UUID: e6591575-f9a1-3289-8b09-6a017fcf57ae
Production of methylcyclohexane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydrgenation of toluene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: No current world market
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e6591575-f9a1-3289-8b09-6a017fcf57ae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
